
# The generated mobile projects. Both are recreated in full by
# `tauri ios init` / `tauri android init`, and neither holds anything hand
# written -- persistent iOS plist keys go in src-tauri/Info.ios.plist, which
# Tauri merges, precisely so nothing here has to survive.
#
# gen/schemas/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it is committed in this repo
# already, and the mobile variants belong with the desktop ones.
gen/apple/

# gen/android/ is deliberately NOT ignored. MainActivity.kt is the one file
# Tauri puts outside generated/, and it carries the window-inset handling that
# keeps the page out from under Android's system bars -- there is no
# configuration field for that, so the source is the only place it can live.
# Tauri ships .gitignore files inside the directory that exclude build output
# and jniLibs. `tauri android init` overwrites MainActivity.kt.
